{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46907","headline":"宜春江上寄仰山长老二首 二 · 齐己","name":"宜春江上寄仰山长老二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨晴天半碧光流，影倒残阳湿郡楼。\n绝顶有人经劫在，浮生无客暂时游。\n窗开万壑春泉乱，塔锁孤灯万木稠。\n欲爲吾师拂衣去，白云红叶又新秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}